language-derived-from-the-record-lines-3 : List (List Word)
language-derived-from-the-record-lines-3 = cons "**1. The record.** A participant i is part of the universe's process (states X, histories h : ℕ → X) and receives it only through its observation o_i : X → Y_i. Its record to t is what it has received: R_i(t) = (o_i(h(t′)))_{t′<t}. Its state at t is a function of its record; that is tautological for a physical system, since nothing reaches i but through o_i." (cons "" nil)
